# Media

- Media references via `media_links` (polymorphic) — never URLs on entity tables
- Upload: client → `POST /api/v1/vendor/media` → StorageService → BullMQ processing job
- Use `StorageService` only — never write to disk directly
- Switch local ↔ R2: change `STORAGE_DRIVER` env var, no code changes
- Validate mime type and size before saving

# Queue / Background Jobs

- All async work via BullMQ (`@nestjs/bullmq`)
- Queue names: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE` constants
- Processors: `src/queue/processors/`
- On failure: log error, update status — do not crash the processor
- Critical jobs (payouts, emails): `attempts: 3` + exponential backoff

```typescript
await this.notificationQueue.add('send-push', { userId, title, body }, {
  attempts: 3,
  backoff: { type: 'exponential', delay: 2000 },
});
```
